        {
          "text": "ak gwayi, “Aba badayda ng'eanyiida ghayi mwaashta NG'UTAMIIDA, jeebi abeeda gaygweaneasa hawdeayda aba gadiyoojigaasa sean hang'oonyi; ak gaguura gheawungaaschi Nuhu.” ",
